This skill studies the MemrisTec Model Library
(https://git-ce.rwth-aachen.de/memristec/memristec-model-library, part of the
DFG priority programme SPP 2262 "MemrisTec" coordinated by TU Dresden). It
contains no code from that library: every model here is written from the
published paper cited in references/models.md. The optional cross-check in
scripts/upstream_adapter.py runs a copy of the library that you clone
yourself; that copy is never redistributed by this project.

